 "remarks": "Welcome to a one-of-a-kind home ideal for multigenerational or extended-family living-just minutes from downtown yet nestled in a peaceful, sought-after Stamford neighborhood. Set on a quiet cul-de-sac and spanning 1.1 acres, this five-bedroom residence offers three full bathrooms on the main level, providing flexible and comfortable living arrangements for multiple generations.The primary suite serves as a private retreat with soaring vaulted ceilings, a spacious en-suite bathroom, and generous walk-in closets. The kitchen and dining areas flow beautifully for shared meals and entertaining, while the living room centers around a cozy fireplace. Hardwood floors run throughout the home, complemented by central air conditioning.The finished lower level includes a large entertainment room with a bar and sliding glass doors that open to the outdoors-perfect as additional living or gathering space. The landscaped grounds feature a patio and swimming pool with a grotto. Completing the property is a three-car garage with versatile space above, ideal for a home office, guest suite, or creative use.",
